There. Then...

337
00:18:31,411 --> 00:18:32,555
You advance it to the right.

338
00:18:32,579 --> 00:18:33,722
Let's do another.
This-This? Yeah.

339
00:18:33,746 --> 00:18:34,746
Okay. Gotcha.

340
00:18:34,814 --> 00:18:36,125
And one, two, three.

341
00:18:36,149 --> 00:18:37,459
That's...

342
00:18:37,483 --> 00:18:40,051
One more for safety, okay?
Give me a great big grin.

343
00:18:40,119 --> 00:18:41,197
There you go.

344
00:18:41,221 --> 00:18:42,865
Oh, that's great.
Thank you. Yeah.

345
00:18:42,889 --> 00:18:43,999
Listen, why don't
you guys go look

346
00:18:44,023 --> 00:18:45,334
at the big engine
down there, all right?

347
00:18:45,358 --> 00:18:46,290
Yeah. Come on.

348
00:18:46,359 --> 00:18:48,292
Yeah.

349
00:18:48,361 --> 00:18:50,361
Nice boys.

350
00:18:50,429 --> 00:18:51,795
Thank you.

351
00:18:51,865 --> 00:18:53,865
They changed my life.

352
00:18:53,933 --> 00:18:55,477
Yeah. Is that the case?

353
00:18:55,501 --> 00:19:00,671
I'm a husband, parent...
respectable man.

354
