384
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:16,847
Well...

385
00:20:16,916 --> 00:20:18,448
We were trying.

386
00:20:18,518 --> 00:20:20,518
Oh.

387
00:20:20,586 --> 00:20:23,253
Oh.

388
00:20:53,152 --> 00:20:55,085
♪ ♪

