Yes, I do.

407
00:22:06,658 --> 00:22:09,359
And hopefully, it's useful.

408
00:22:09,429 --> 00:22:13,430
Do you like jelly beans?

409
00:22:13,499 --> 00:22:15,432
Yes.

410
00:22:20,840 --> 00:22:22,120
Mmm!

411
00:22:23,576 --> 00:22:26,843
I thought Mr. O'Malley sent
