414
00:22:34,019 --> 00:22:36,579
I don't take orders at all.

415
00:22:44,897 --> 00:22:46,230
Got to go.

416
00:22:46,299 --> 00:22:47,943
It's been...

417
00:22:47,967 --> 00:22:50,100
brief.

418
