I won't be this nice.

425
00:24:40,813 --> 00:24:42,179
Oh, Ms. O'Malley.

426
00:24:42,248 --> 00:24:43,314
Yes?

427
00:24:43,382 --> 00:24:45,327
Uh, I'd like to talk
with you about Sam.

428
00:24:45,351 --> 00:24:46,351
No.

429
00:24:46,419 --> 00:24:47,729
Surely, you could
spare a moment.

430
00:24:47,753 --> 00:24:49,453
No! I said no.

431
00:24:49,522 --> 00:24:51,955
I've spent 15 years
married to a criminal

432
00:24:52,024 --> 00:24:53,289
