Oh.

458
00:26:04,764 --> 00:26:06,096
Let's get right to it.

459
00:26:09,935 --> 00:26:11,201
Sam Chandler.

460
00:26:11,270 --> 00:26:12,736
Quite a guy.

461
00:26:12,805 --> 00:26:14,938
David O'Malley does
one phenomenal job

462
00:26:15,007 --> 00:26:16,007
