463
00:26:16,075 --> 00:26:18,175
and then Sam sleeps
with his wife in return.

464
00:26:18,244 --> 00:26:20,077
Yeah. Yeah.

465
00:26:21,413 --> 00:26:24,147
I remember your father's death.

466
00:26:24,216 --> 00:26:26,349
So do I.

467
00:26:26,418 --> 00:26:28,363
At the time, there
was some speculation

468
00:26:28,387 --> 00:26:30,798
that Sam had a hand in it.

469
00:26:30,822 --> 00:26:33,223
It wasn't speculation.

470
00:26:33,292 --> 00:26:35,336
I never got involved
in my father's business.

471
00:26:35,360 --> 00:26:36,726
I never wanted to.

472
00:26:36,796 --> 00:26:38,595
Then, one day, I got a call.

473
00:26:38,664 --> 00:26:40,764
My father was shot
four times in the head

474
00:26:40,833 --> 00:26:44,134
