I didn't want that kind of life.

484
00:27:09,929 --> 00:27:12,930
Mr. Matlock, I didn't
kill Sam Chandler.

485
00:27:12,998 --> 00:27:14,697
If I'd have wanted to do that,

486
00:27:14,766 --> 00:27:16,686
