489
00:27:24,543 --> 00:27:25,909
Jogging.

490
00:27:25,978 --> 00:27:27,243
I jog every morning.

491
00:27:27,312 --> 00:27:28,678
Well, uh,

492
00:27:28,748 --> 00:27:30,447
did... did anybody, uh...

493
00:27:30,515 --> 00:27:31,815
People see me?

494
00:27:31,884 --> 00:27:33,462
I don't know if
anybody remembers

495
00:27:33,486 --> 00:27:35,018
seeing me that particular day.

496
00:27:53,005 --> 00:27:54,605
