Hey, hey, hey.

506
00:28:14,426 --> 00:28:15,725
Huh?

507
00:28:15,795 --> 00:28:18,561
Hey, they'll pay me
off in a couple of days.

508
00:28:18,630 --> 00:28:20,797
Soon as I get the
money, we're gone.

509
00:28:24,503 --> 00:28:26,370
Okay. Go.

510
00:28:35,514 --> 00:28:36,624
Yeah, Vicki.

511
00:28:36,648 --> 00:28:38,015
How are you, huh?

512
00:28:38,084 --> 00:28:39,724
I'm fine. Good, good.

513
00:28:39,752 --> 00:28:42,312
Come here. Come here.

514
00:29:09,782 --> 00:29:11,481
You look exhausted.

515
00:29:11,549 --> 00:29:12,849
Had a bad night.

516
00:29:12,918 --> 00:29:13,995
Mmm.

517
00:29:14,019 --> 00:29:15,218
